      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note: Theoretically, we could skip the addition of the self-dependency for renderpasses which do not need to support reading the dst as an input attachment (`!fSupportReadingDstAsInput`, which can be encountered when the render target does not have input attachment usage). This would be similar to how we opt for layouts optimized for specific usages when `!fSupportReadingDstAsInput`. But if it\u0027s free, including it anyways streamlines some logic / reduces key size. \n\nsidebar: Of course, the key *could* theoretically just have 1 bit to indicate this, but that circumvents all the work here to have this key generation be more generalized for future render pass description structure.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 197,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 198,
        "endChar": 62
      },
      "revId": "16c80c6463ae94438e5e471450e9997af3b7429b",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
